{
  "date": "2026-11-05",
  "category": "finance",
  "title_zh": "债市下跌让理财产品净值下降，多家理财公司呼吁投资者冷静",
  "title_en": "Bond market fall lowers wealth product values; several wealth managers urge investors to stay calm",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "zh": "10月30日，中国债券市场价格下跌，股票市场也一起下跌。那天正好是月末，市场上的资金比较紧，还有人提前卖出债券基金。",
      "en": "On October 30, prices in China's bond market fell, and the stock market fell at the same time. It happened to be month-end, funds in the market were fairly tight, and some people sold bond funds early."
    },
    {
      "zh": "因为这些情况，10月30日和11月2日，一部分风险较低的理财产品净值下降了。当天，10年期国债收益率收在1.624%，30年期国债收益率收在2.08%。",
      "en": "Because of this, on October 30 and November 2 the net asset value of some lower-risk wealth products went down. That day, the 10-year government bond yield closed at 1.624% and the 30-year yield closed at 2.08%."
    },
    {
      "zh": "工银理财和华夏理财等多家公司发了文章，请投资者不要情绪化地买卖。它们建议大家继续持有产品，不要在价格低的时候被迫卖出。这些公司还表示，已经缩短了产品的久期，并且调整了投资组合。",
      "en": "ICBC Wealth Management, ChinaAMC Wealth Management and several other firms published articles asking investors not to buy and sell emotionally. They suggested that everyone keep holding their products and not be forced to sell when prices are low. These firms also said they had shortened the duration of their products and adjusted their portfolios."
    },
    {
      "zh": "到了11月4日，股票和债券都上涨了。上证指数涨了2.16%，深证成指涨了4.22%，创业板指涨了6.4%，一天的成交额超过2万亿元。10年期国债收益率降到1.6%以下，30年期国债收益率收在2.049%。",
      "en": "By November 4, both stocks and bonds had risen. The Shanghai Composite Index rose 2.16%, the Shenzhen Component Index rose 4.22%, the ChiNext Index rose 6.4%, and one day's turnover exceeded 2 trillion yuan. The 10-year government bond yield fell below 1.6%, and the 30-year yield closed at 2.049%."
    }
  ],
